1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,647
Every time you tap 'Buy Now', an invisible journey begins across modern distributed infrastructure.

2
00:00:07,099 --> 00:00:18,161
Your request connects to the API Gateway. Here, TLS encryption terminates, JWT security tokens are verified, and rate limits are strictly enforced.

3
00:00:18,609 --> 00:00:29,479
Inside the private cluster, the request routes to the Order Service. It queries an in-memory Redis cache before reaching database indexes in microseconds.

4
00:00:29,929 --> 00:00:39,408
Here in the backend controller, asynchronous workers process business validation, commit database transactions, and dispatch confirmation events.

5
00:00:39,859 --> 00:00:47,801
In under fifty milliseconds, the response returns—a testament to the precision of modern distributed software engineering.
